  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"WYVJm\" id=\"WYVJm\"><span data-lake-id=\"u41ddcd78\" id=\"u41ddcd78\">0&gt; 功能需求</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u0c0c6eda\" id=\"u0c0c6eda\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub6eba9a1\" id=\"ub6eba9a1\">通过一个简单的程序，演示如何使用 &amp; 和 % 判断一个整数是否是 4的倍数，并对比两者的实现方式</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"Qma6l\" id=\"Qma6l\"><span data-lake-id=\"u80e82dca\" id=\"u80e82dca\">1&gt; 代码验证</span></h1><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%20%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20num%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%E8%AF%B7%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%B4%E6%95%B0%3A%20%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20scanf(%5C%22%25d%5C%22%2C%20%26num)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%951%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%A8%20%25%20%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%98%AF4%E7%9A%84%E5%80%8D%E6%95%B0%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20(num%20%25%204%20%3D%3D%200)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%951%EF%BC%88%25%25%EF%BC%89%3A%20%25d%20%E6%98%AF4%E7%9A%84%E5%80%8D%E6%95%B0%E3%80%82%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20num)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%20else%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%951%EF%BC%88%25%25%EF%BC%89%3A%20%25d%20%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF4%E7%9A%84%E5%80%8D%E6%95%B0%E3%80%82%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20num)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%952%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%A8%20%26%20%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%98%AF4%E7%9A%84%E5%80%8D%E6%95%B0%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20((num%20%26%200x03)%20%3D%3D%200)%20%7B%20%20%2F%2F%200x03%20%3D%200b0011%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%E8%BF%9B%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%89%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%952%EF%BC%88%26%EF%BC%89%3A%20%25d%20%E6%98%AF4%E7%9A%84%E5%80%8D%E6%95%B0%E3%80%82%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20num)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%20else%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%952%EF%BC%88%26%EF%BC%89%3A%20%25d%20%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF4%E7%9A%84%E5%80%8D%E6%95%B0%E3%80%82%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20num)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Zj7ip%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ua8bf78e5\" id=\"ua8bf78e5\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub291d79a\" id=\"ub291d79a\">方法(1) %（取模运算）</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u393a503f\" id=\"u393a503f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u611983ed\" id=\"u611983ed\">num % 4 计算 num 除以4的余数。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u28e27e48\" id=\"u28e27e48\"><span data-lake-id=\"u285d2b27\" id=\"u285d2b27\">若余数为0，说明是4的倍数。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2299a89e\" id=\"u2299a89e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua6983dcc\" id=\"ua6983dcc\">例如：8 % 4 = 0（是4的倍数），7 % 4 = 3（不是）。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u80ccffa6\" id=\"u80ccffa6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8693c322\" id=\"u8693c322\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uddc2ecf4\" id=\"uddc2ecf4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u133ce1d6\" id=\"u133ce1d6\">方法(2) &amp;（按位与运算）</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u04e90ec6\" id=\"u04e90ec6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u12dfa0da\" id=\"u12dfa0da\">num &amp; 0x03 提取 num 的最低2位（因为 4 = 2^2）。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf87ba5f6\" id=\"uf87ba5f6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3e6f87c7\" id=\"u3e6f87c7\">若最低2位全为0（即 (num &amp; 0x03) == 0），说明是4的倍数。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3b3c4f67\" id=\"u3b3c4f67\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9a9fafeb\" id=\"u9a9fafeb\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uae116079\" id=\"uae116079\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub0325887\" id=\"ub0325887\">例如：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uca4518b3\" id=\"uca4518b3\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf45f87b4\" id=\"uf45f87b4\">8 的二进制：0b1000</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3662db09\" id=\"u3662db09\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucf4f7b60\" id=\"ucf4f7b60\">0b1000 &amp; 0b0011 = 0b0000（是4的倍数）。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u751c35e3\" id=\"u751c35e3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u01fba856\" id=\"u01fba856\">7 的二进制：0b0111</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1832874b\" id=\"u1832874b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue1f998ea\" id=\"ue1f998ea\">0b0111 &amp; 0b0011 = 0b0011（不是）。</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22iDi9j%22%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"gIMOM\" id=\"gIMOM\"><span data-lake-id=\"u59095faa\" id=\"u59095faa\">2&gt; &amp; 和 %区别</span></h1><table data-lake-id=\"hw9bO\" id=\"hw9bO\" margin=\"true\" width-mode=\"contain\" class=\"lake-table\" style=\"width: 579px\"><colgroup><col width=\"153\"><col width=\"146\"><col width=\"280\"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id=\"u258f09a0\" id=\"u258f09a0\"><td data-lake-id=\"u63342c64\" id=\"u63342c64\" style=\"background-color: #81BBF8\"><p data-lake-id=\"ua233f326\" id=\"ua233f326\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u071861c7\" id=\"u071861c7\" style=\"background-color: #81BBF8\"><p data-lake-id=\"ubfdb1dad\" id=\"ubfdb1dad\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufd70660f\" id=\"ufd70660f\">%</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u4e927b5e\" id=\"u4e927b5e\" style=\"background-color: #81BBF8\"><p data-lake-id=\"u7c70e794\" id=\"u7c70e794\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"u507cbfc0\" id=\"u507cbfc0\">&amp;</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"ueab68111\" id=\"ueab68111\" style=\"height: 36px\"><td data-lake-id=\"u9d633206\" id=\"u9d633206\"><p data-lake-id=\"ubc46e187\" id=\"ubc46e187\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u82f74338\" id=\"u82f74338\">类型</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u5a486187\" id=\"u5a486187\"><p data-lake-id=\"u4f8153f7\" id=\"u4f8153f7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u15cf8c42\" id=\"u15cf8c42\">数学运算</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u8f1cd5f5\" id=\"u8f1cd5f5\"><p data-lake-id=\"u8f736fe1\" id=\"u8f736fe1\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf2d4f619\" id=\"uf2d4f619\">位运算</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u9d5443ba\" id=\"u9d5443ba\"><td data-lake-id=\"u59dafdc0\" id=\"u59dafdc0\"><p data-lake-id=\"uad9a0ab3\" id=\"uad9a0ab3\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uedf01d07\" id=\"uedf01d07\">底层操作</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"ua65fa20e\" id=\"ua65fa20e\"><p data-lake-id=\"u0d3ab739\" id=\"u0d3ab739\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4ad8b841\" id=\"u4ad8b841\">除法求余</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u5b31460a\" id=\"u5b31460a\"><p data-lake-id=\"u2a72c78b\" id=\"u2a72c78b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6625199a\" id=\"u6625199a\">二进制位操作</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u7c37af7e\" id=\"u7c37af7e\"><td data-lake-id=\"ue266f251\" id=\"ue266f251\"><p data-lake-id=\"u0656dd01\" id=\"u0656dd01\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u03e5cb01\" id=\"u03e5cb01\">性能对比</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u931d119c\" id=\"u931d119c\"><p data-lake-id=\"ua34df6ba\" id=\"ua34df6ba\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud8916fd0\" id=\"ud8916fd0\">慢</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u0aaffa59\" id=\"u0aaffa59\"><p data-lake-id=\"u54a0b5b4\" id=\"u54a0b5b4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2f61cf04\" id=\"u2f61cf04\">高效</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"ua2da5787\" id=\"ua2da5787\"><td data-lake-id=\"u62d4d697\" id=\"u62d4d697\"><p data-lake-id=\"u93f25f90\" id=\"u93f25f90\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u22e163e2\" id=\"u22e163e2\">适用场景</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"uf99612df\" id=\"uf99612df\"><p data-lake-id=\"ue81cb3ed\" id=\"ue81cb3ed\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3b2b7224\" id=\"u3b2b7224\">通用（任意除数）</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u2b3811b4\" id=\"u2b3811b4\"><p data-lake-id=\"u1e8866fc\" id=\"u1e8866fc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u05944408\" id=\"u05944408\">判断2的幂次方对齐（如，4，8，16）</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
